{
 "title": "作为表达式的 match",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "`match` 也可以产生一个值：用 `=>` 把每个分支绑定到单个表达式，并把结果赋给变量或用 `return` 返回。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn error_message(code: i32) -> str:",
    "    return match code:",
    "        0 => \"success\"",
    "        1 => \"file not found\"",
    "        2 => \"access denied\"",
    "        _ => \"general error\"",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    print(error_message(2))",
    "    msg = match 0:",
    "        0 => \"OK\"",
    "        _ => \"Error!\"",
    "    print(msg)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "access denied",
    "OK"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c06-l04-x1",
   "prompt": "编写 `days_in(month: i32) -> i32`（二月为 28）：2 => 28；4、6、9、11 => 30；其他 => 31。输出 9 月的天数。",
   "starter": [
    "fn days_in(month: i32) -> i32:",
    "    return 0",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    print(days_in(9))"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "fn days_in(month: i32) -> i32:",
    "    return match month:",
    "        2 => 28",
    "        4 | 6 | 9 | 11 => 30",
    "        _ => 31",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    print(days_in(9))"
   ],
   "hint": "在 `return match month:` 之后写三个分支。",
   "expected": [
    "30"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c06-l04-q1",
   "q": "在表达式形式的 `match` 中，每个分支的值必须怎样？",
   "options": [
    "可以是任意类型",
    "必须是同一类型",
    "必须是字符串"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "结果会放进同一个变量，所以类型必须一致。"
  }
 ]
}
